<!DOCTYPE html>
    <html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" lang="en-US"><head><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" /><title>Learn how to configure a dead-letter queue redrive in Amazon SQS - Amazon Simple Queue Service</title><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" /><meta name="assets_root" content="/assets" /><meta name="target_state" content="sqs-configure-dead-letter-queue-redrive" /><meta name="default_state" content="sqs-configure-dead-letter-queue-redrive" /><link rel="icon" type="image/ico" href="/assets/images/favicon.ico" /><link rel="shortcut icon" type="image/ico" href="/assets/images/favicon.ico" /><link rel="canonical" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSSimpleQueueService/latest/SQSDeveloperGuide/sqs-configure-dead-letter-queue-redrive.html" /><meta name="description" content="Learn how to configure an Amazon SQS dead-letter queue redrive to move messages from a dead-letter queue to a source queue or other standard queue." /><meta name="deployment_region" content="IAD" /><meta name="product" content="Amazon Simple Queue Service" /><meta name="guide" content="Developer Guide" /><meta name="abstract" content="Queue messages that one component in the application generates to be consumed by another component using Amazon SQS." /><meta name="guide-locale" content="en_us" /><meta name="tocs" content="toc-contents.json" /><link rel="canonical" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSSimpleQueueService/latest/SQSDeveloperGuide/sqs-configure-dead-letter-queue-redrive.html" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/id_id/AWSSimpleQueueService/latest/SQSDeveloperGuide/sqs-configure-dead-letter-queue-redrive.html" hreflang="id-id" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/id_id/AWSSimpleQueueService/latest/SQSDeveloperGuide/sqs-configure-dead-letter-queue-redrive.html" hreflang="id" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/de_de/AWSSimpleQueueService/latest/SQSDeveloperGuide/sqs-configure-dead-letter-queue-redrive.html" hreflang="de-de" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/de_de/AWSSimpleQueueService/latest/SQSDeveloperGuide/sqs-configure-dead-letter-queue-redrive.html" hreflang="de" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSSimpleQueueService/latest/SQSDeveloperGuide/sqs-configure-dead-letter-queue-redrive.html" hreflang="en-us" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSSimpleQueueService/latest/SQSDeveloperGuide/sqs-configure-dead-letter-queue-redrive.html" hreflang="en" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/es_es/AWSSimpleQueueService/latest/SQSDeveloperGuide/sqs-configure-dead-letter-queue-redrive.html" hreflang="es-es" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/es_es/AWSSimpleQueueService/latest/SQSDeveloperGuide/sqs-configure-dead-letter-queue-redrive.html" hreflang="es" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/fr_fr/AWSSimpleQueueService/latest/SQSDeveloperGuide/sqs-configure-dead-letter-queue-redrive.html" hreflang="fr-fr" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/fr_fr/AWSSimpleQueueService/latest/SQSDeveloperGuide/sqs-configure-dead-letter-queue-redrive.html" hreflang="fr" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/it_it/AWSSimpleQueueService/latest/SQSDeveloperGuide/sqs-configure-dead-letter-queue-redrive.html" hreflang="it-it" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/it_it/AWSSimpleQueueService/latest/SQSDeveloperGuide/sqs-configure-dead-letter-queue-redrive.html" hreflang="it" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/ja_jp/AWSSimpleQueueService/latest/SQSDeveloperGuide/sqs-configure-dead-letter-queue-redrive.html" hreflang="ja-jp" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/ja_jp/AWSSimpleQueueService/latest/SQSDeveloperGuide/sqs-configure-dead-letter-queue-redrive.html" hreflang="ja" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/ko_kr/AWSSimpleQueueService/latest/SQSDeveloperGuide/sqs-configure-dead-letter-queue-redrive.html" hreflang="ko-kr" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/ko_kr/AWSSimpleQueueService/latest/SQSDeveloperGuide/sqs-configure-dead-letter-queue-redrive.html" hreflang="ko" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/pt_br/AWSSimpleQueueService/latest/SQSDeveloperGuide/sqs-configure-dead-letter-queue-redrive.html" hreflang="pt-br" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/pt_br/AWSSimpleQueueService/latest/SQSDeveloperGuide/sqs-configure-dead-letter-queue-redrive.html" hreflang="pt" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/zh_cn/AWSSimpleQueueService/latest/SQSDeveloperGuide/sqs-configure-dead-letter-queue-redrive.html" hreflang="zh-cn" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/zh_tw/AWSSimpleQueueService/latest/SQSDeveloperGuide/sqs-configure-dead-letter-queue-redrive.html" hreflang="zh-tw" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSSimpleQueueService/latest/SQSDeveloperGuide/sqs-configure-dead-letter-queue-redrive.html" hreflang="x-default" /><meta name="feedback-item" content="SQS" /><meta name="this_doc_product" content="Amazon Simple Queue Service" /><meta name="this_doc_guide" content="Developer Guide" /><head xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"> <script defer="" src="/assets/r/awsdocs-doc-page.2.0.0.js"></script><link href="/assets/r/awsdocs-doc-page.2.0.0.css" rel="stylesheet"/></head>
<script defer="" id="awsc-panorama-bundle" type="text/javascript" src="https://prod.pa.cdn.uis.awsstatic.com/panorama-nav-init.js" data-config="{'appEntity':'aws-documentation','region':'us-east-1','service':'sqs'}"></script><meta id="panorama-serviceSubSection" value="Developer Guide" /><meta id="panorama-serviceConsolePage" value="Learn how to configure a dead-letter queue redrive in Amazon SQS" /></head><body class="awsdocs awsui"><div class="awsdocs-container"><p><a href="sqs-configure-dead-letter-queue-redrive.md">View a markdown version of this page</a></p><awsdocs-header></awsdocs-header><awsui-app-layout id="app-layout" class="awsui-util-no-gutters" ng-controller="ContentController as $ctrl" header-selector="awsdocs-header" navigation-hide="false" navigation-width="$ctrl.navWidth" navigation-open="$ctrl.navOpen" navigation-change="$ctrl.onNavChange($event)" tools-hide="$ctrl.hideTools" tools-width="$ctrl.toolsWidth" tools-open="$ctrl.toolsOpen" tools-change="$ctrl.onToolsChange($event)"><div id="guide-toc" dom-region="navigation"><awsdocs-toc></awsdocs-toc></div><div id="main-column" dom-region="content" tabindex="-1"><awsdocs-view class="awsdocs-view"><div id="awsdocs-content"><head><title>Learn how to configure a dead-letter queue redrive in Amazon SQS - Amazon Simple Queue Service</title><meta name="pdf" content="/pdfs/AWSSimpleQueueService/latest/SQSDeveloperGuide/sqs-dg.pdf#sqs-configure-dead-letter-queue-redrive" /><meta name="rss" content="recent-updates.rss" /><meta name="forums" content="https://repost.aws/tags/TAA-iV52DNQ4a7bbpyH3s33Q" /><meta name="feedback" content="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/forms/aws-doc-feedback?hidden_service_name=SQS&amp;topic_url=https://docs.aws.amazon.com/en_us/AWSSimpleQueueService/latest/SQSDeveloperGuide/sqs-configure-dead-letter-queue-redrive.html" /><meta name="feedback-yes" content="feedbackyes.html?topic_url=https://docs.aws.amazon.com/en_us/AWSSimpleQueueService/latest/SQSDeveloperGuide/sqs-configure-dead-letter-queue-redrive.html" /><meta name="feedback-no" content="feedbackno.html?topic_url=https://docs.aws.amazon.com/en_us/AWSSimpleQueueService/latest/SQSDeveloperGuide/sqs-configure-dead-letter-queue-redrive.html" /><meta name="keywords" content="Queue message identifiers,message metadata,queue pagination,cost allocation tags,dead letter queues,visibility timeout,delay queues,temporary queues,message timers,dead-letter queues,DLQ,message handling,redrive,unconsumed messages,dead-letter queue redrive,configuration,FIFO queue,redrive velocity,message order,API actions,standard queue,asynchronous task,Amazon SQS console,configuration steps,message destination,velocity control settings,queue permissions,API methods,IAM policies" /><link rel="alternate" type="text/markdown" href="sqs-configure-dead-letter-queue-redrive.md" title="Markdown version" /><script type="application/ld+json">
